# Tasks: Taskwarrior WebUI Enhancement

**Input**: Design documents from `speckit.specify` and `speckit.plan`
**Target Repository**: `https://github.com/pplupo/taskwarrior-webui` (`/home/pplupo/repos/webui2`)

---

## Phase 1: Setup & Foundational Prerequisites

**Purpose**: Scaffold project structure and dependency foundation

- [ ] T001 Verify `spec-kit` configuration and directory scaffold in `/home/pplupo/repos/webui2`.
- [ ] T002 Add required npm packages (`vuedraggable`, `hotkeys-js`) in `frontend/package.json`.
- [ ] T003 Configure hotkey plugin registration structure in `frontend/plugins/hotkeys.ts`.

---

## Phase 2: User Story 1 - Keyboard Navigation & Mnemonic Overlay Engine (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP

**Goal**: Enable keyboard-centric navigation, search focus (`Ctrl+Shift+K`), and dynamic 1-2 character mnemonic red-box overlays on UI elements.

### Implementation Tasks
- [ ] T004 [P] [US1] Create hotkey engine plugin in `frontend/plugins/hotkeys.ts` with global listeners.
- [ ] T005 [P] [US1] Implement mnemonic generator utility in `frontend/utils/mnemonics.ts` mapping shortcuts to task IDs, tags, projects, and queries.
- [ ] T006 [US1] Update `frontend/components/TaskList.vue` to render red-box mnemonic overlay badges over task items.
- [ ] T007 [US1] Wire `Ctrl+Shift+K` to focus the search bar across `frontend/pages/index.vue` and `frontend/layouts/default.vue`.

---

## Phase 3: User Story 2 - Active Task Timer & Timewarrior Integration (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP

**Goal**: Display currently running task widget (`+ACTIVE`), allow starting/stopping timers, and auto-stop previously running tasks.

### Implementation Tasks
- [ ] T008 [P] [US2] Implement active task endpoint (`GET /api/tasks/active`) in `backend/src/tasks.ts`.
- [ ] T009 [P] [US2] Implement start and stop timer endpoints (`POST /api/tasks/:uuid/start`, `POST /api/tasks/:uuid/stop`) in `backend/src/tasks.ts`.
- [ ] T10 [US2] Extend Vuex state (`frontend/store/index.ts`) with `activeTask` state and timer actions.
- [ ] T011 [US2] Create floating timer component `frontend/components/ActiveTaskBar.vue` with start/stop triggers.
- [ ] T012 [US2] Integrate `ActiveTaskBar` widget into `frontend/layouts/default.vue`.

---

## Phase 4: User Story 3 - TWKB-Inspired Kanban Board View (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP

**Goal**: Provide a responsive 4-column Kanban board (`To Do`, `In Progress`, `Waiting`, `Done`) with drag-and-drop state updates and rich card metadata chips.

### Implementation Tasks
- [ ] T013 [P] [US3] Create `frontend/components/KanbanCard.vue` displaying urgency, priority chips, project tags, blocked indicators, and inline action buttons.
- [ ] T014 [US3] Create `frontend/components/KanbanBoard.vue` implementing 4-column drag-and-drop layout via `vuedraggable`.
- [ ] T015 [US3] Wire drag-and-drop state handlers in `KanbanBoard.vue` to trigger timer start (when moved to In Progress) and completion (when moved to Done).
- [ ] T016 [US3] Add `Kanban` display mode option to `frontend/pages/index.vue` view switcher.

---

## Phase 5: User Story 4 - Undo System & Revert Preview (Priority: P2)

**Goal**: Provide an operation revert report preview (`/tasks/undo/report`) and confirmable `task undo` execution.

### Implementation Tasks
- [ ] T017 [P] [US4] Implement undo preview endpoint (`GET /api/tasks/undo/preview`) in `backend/src/tasks.ts`.
- [ ] T018 [P] [US4] Implement undo execution endpoint (`POST /api/tasks/undo`) in `backend/src/tasks.ts`.
- [ ] T019 [US4] Create `frontend/components/UndoDialog.vue` to render operations revert preview before confirming undo.
- [ ] T020 [US4] Bind `u` keyboard shortcut in `frontend/plugins/hotkeys.ts` to trigger `UndoDialog`.

---

## Phase 6: User Story 5 - Custom Queries Engine & Detailed Task Modifiers (Priority: P2)

**Goal**: Support custom queries via config/env vars with shortcut keys, dependency tree sorting, annotation editing, and free-form CLI modifiers.

### Implementation Tasks
- [ ] T021 [P] [US5] Implement custom queries loader (`GET /api/config/queries`) in `backend/src/queries.ts`.
- [ ] T022 [P] [US5] Implement task annotation & modifier endpoints (`POST /api/tasks/:uuid/annotate`, `POST /api/tasks/:uuid/modify`) in `backend/src/tasks.ts`.
- [ ] T023 [US5] Create `frontend/components/CustomQueryBar.vue` with keybindings support.
- [ ] T024 [US5] Enhance `frontend/components/TaskDialog.vue` with dependency tree viewer, annotation manager, and free-form Taskwarrior command modifier input.

